flowchart TB
    subgraph UA[Browser]
        B1[Open protected app URL]
        B2[Follow redirect to IdP]
        B3[Submit credentials / MFA]
        B4[POST SAML response to app]
    end
    subgraph SP[Service provider]
        S1[Detect no session]
        S2[Build AuthnRequest]
        S3[Validate signature and assertion]
        S4[Create session cookie]
    end
    subgraph IdP[Identity provider]
        I1[Parse AuthnRequest]
        I2{Existing IdP session?}
        I3[Authenticate user]
        I4[Generate signed assertion]
    end
    B1 --> S1 --> S2 --> B2 --> I1 --> I2
    I2 -->|No| I3
    I3 --> B3 --> I3
    I2 -->|Yes| I4
    I3 --> I4 --> B4 --> S3 --> S4 --> B1

